              "text" : "Zeta middle schools open up new possibilities. Students discover interests, become more independent, and find their voices. Learning takes many forms at Zeta. In expert-led Specialties, students can learn an instrument, develop a chess strategy, or master Taekwondo. In Z Lab, they build robots, write code, and bring their ideas to life. Caring teachers help students navigate these challenges with love and high expectations. Daily Advisory and weekly Circles give students time to reflect, build friendships, and set goals with adults who know them well.<br />"
