              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "<font face=\"Tahoma\">In 2025–26, our eighth graders earned 98% pass rates on both the Algebra I and Biology Regents exams, typically taken in high school. Their achievements reflect what students can accomplish with rigorous coursework and caring teachers by their side.<br /><br />To learn more about what middle school could look like, come visit us! Meet our students and teachers, explore our classrooms, and see the possibilities for your student’s next chapter.<br /><br /><strong>With love,</strong><strong><br /><br />Emily Kim<br />Founder &amp; CEO<br />Zeta Charter Schools</strong><strong><br /></strong><br /><em></em><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta. Our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way:<br /></em>✉︎ <a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>enroll&#64;zetaschools.org</u></a><br />&#x1f4de;<a href=\"tel:16464801654\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(646) 480-1654</a></font><a href=\"tel:16464801654\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a><br />"
